WEBVTT

00:04:59.893 --> 00:05:01.769
"I called a girl I wished to love."

00:05:01.793 --> 00:05:03.576
They basically went out on a date,

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:06.852
and he says at the end
that he didn't "achieve" her up till now.

00:05:06.876 --> 00:05:08.040
(Laughter)

00:05:08.064 --> 00:05:10.035
Here's a guy from Canada.

00:05:10.059 --> 00:05:11.766
Very similar thing.

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:13.781
"I took my girlfriend out for dinner.

00:05:13.805 --> 00:05:15.646
We went to a movie, we left early,

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:19.469
and then went back to her room
for ... cake," just cake.

00:05:19.493 --> 00:05:20.847
(Laughter)

00:05:20.871 --> 00:05:22.024
Human universal:

00:05:22.048 --> 00:05:24.284
you spend money on others,
you're being nice.

00:05:24.308 --> 00:05:26.373
Maybe you have something
in mind, maybe not.

00:05:26.397 --> 00:05:28.449
But then we see extraordinary differences.

00:05:28.473 --> 00:05:29.626
So look at these two.

00:05:29.650 --> 00:05:31.004
This is a woman from Canada.